he run still exits 0. `unittest discover` and `pytest` import the module without running the guard, so they do run these tests.\n\nMove the guard to the end of the file.\n\nIf this file is a byte-preserving import of the live baseline, make this fix in a separate follow-up PR. A retrieved learning records that policy for the crq import.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n-    unittest.main()\n```\n\nAdd this at the end of the file, after Line 244:\n\n```python\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    unittest.main()\n```\n</details>\n\nBased on learnings: the owner requires behavioral fixes to stay in separate crq follow-up PRs when the change is a byte-preserving import of the live baseline.","id":"c004de1e21389cdf5b873288369ec1d59d3d958c536510a8e99ea8feb54ad608","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_status_summary.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"`unittest.main()` runs before `MergedCurrentSummaryTest` is defined (teststatussummary.py:164-165, class at 168)."}],"head":"065c7a2aa63e6cd715f8d05b6d3ee80648fd604a","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"670d968eda5e1f6bec131a0497edfca32126d5a3","intervals":[[1,84]],"path":"apps/crq-python/PROVENANCE.md"},{"blob":"0ba88d70f0bdad84604516bc0437aee719158187","intervals":[[1,209]],"path":"apps/crq-python/README.md"},{"blob":"83cc38bf0716c2b073fe481bddfa22bc32d01811","intervals":[[1,286]],"path":"apps/crq-python/status_summary.py"},{"blob":"87adda22b2aedff836f1b781e5d827c454822c4c","intervals":[[1,1098]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_author_quota.py"},{"blob":"4bfeb2ffbd5e4cd16cd2e8af10b6d0c8fa23a16f","intervals":[[1,244]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_status_summary.py"}],"job_id":"aceb854d5603659ab8054c0f81ff9e67cbdf30e7405527aee3c8c07d0eed9f63:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"670d968eda5e1f6bec131a0497edfca32126d5a3